OL,11,G0350 Witness History
OL,12,     FIn 1995 Octavia E Butler became
OL,13,     Fthe first author to receive a
OL,14,     FMacArthur "genius" award for her
OL,15,     Fscience-fiction writing. During
OL,16,     Fher career, she overcame poverty,
OL,17,     Fracism and sexism.
